WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.427
"I want to drive a car!" said Kip.

2
00:00:11.428 --> 00:00:16.771
"I don't want to drive a car," said Bird.

3
00:00:16.772 --> 00:00:20.555
"Cars are too fast."

4
00:00:20.556 --> 00:00:24.782
"Vroom! Vroom!" said Kip.

5
00:00:24.783 --> 00:00:27.110
Kip zoomed along the branch.

6
00:00:27.111 --> 00:00:31.020
"I'm a race car driver!" he said.

7
00:00:31.021 --> 00:00:35.433
Kip zoomed up and down the tree trunk.

8
00:00:35.434 --> 00:00:39.256
"I'm a fast race car driver!" he said.

9
00:00:39.257 --> 00:00:42.799
"And I'm going to win the big race!"

10
00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.955
Bird was watching Kip. "Be

11
00:00:44.956 --> 00:00:47.913
careful, Kip," she said. "Vroom!

12
00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:53.216
Vroom! Vroom!" said Kip. "You

13
00:00:53.217 --> 00:00:57.210
are running very fast," said Bird. "You

14
00:00:57.211 --> 00:01:01.745
mean I'm driving very fast!" said Kip. "And

15
00:01:01.746 --> 00:01:05.716
you're not being very careful," said Bird. "Nobody

16
00:01:05.717 --> 00:01:12.096
is faster than me!" said Kip. Just

17
00:01:12.097 --> 00:01:14.509
then Kip tripped. He

18
00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:16.889
went flying into the air. "Oh

19
00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:19.163
no!" cried Kip. "Oh

20
00:01:19.164 --> 00:01:22.019
no!" cried Bird. Crash

21
00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:23.950
!

22
00:01:23.951 --> 00:01:27.723
Kip smashed right into Bird's nest!

